<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Vision Transformers that Never Stop Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
