<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The weight metrics of components in blocks of ViT, including effective rank and magnitude of 12 head, the FC layer 1, FC layer 2 of FFN, and attention projection.</p>
</div>
