<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 23: </span>The weight magnitude of 12 attention heads in ViT, block 3. The green curve represents the weight magnitude of <math id="A1.F23.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math> matrix. The blue and red curves represent the weight magnitude of <math id="A1.F23.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.F23.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F24" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2603.07787v1/block_10_qkv_weight_magnitude.svg" id="A1.F24.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/250;" width="381" height="250"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 24: </span>The weight magnitude of 12 attention heads in ViT, block 11. The green curve represents the weight magnitude of <math id="A1.F24.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math> matrix. The blue and red curves represent the weight magnitude of <math id="A1.F24.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.F24.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively.</figcaption>
